# local-only research notes (personal reference, not for the repo)
/docs/

# Markdown — prose belongs in packages/specs/
# Exception: content-collection files under src/content/works/ are tracked (they are
# data fixtures, not prose docs — the schema loader requires both .md and .mdx).
*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/packages/specs/**/*.md
!/packages/site/src/content/works/**/*.md
!/packages/site/tests/fixtures/**/*.md
